CHECK:UNNECESSARY_PARENTHESES: Unnecessary parentheses around file->f_path
#50: FILE: fs/sysfs/file.c:134:
+       path = d_path(&(file->f_path), pathname, sizeof(pathname));

Parentheses are not required in the following cases:

  1. Function pointer uses::

      (foo->bar)();

    could be::

      foo->bar();

  2. Comparisons in if::

      if ((foo->bar) && (foo->baz))
      if ((foo == bar))

    could be::

      if (foo->bar && foo->baz)
      if (foo == bar)

  3. addressof/dereference single Lvalues::

      &(foo->bar)
      *(foo->bar)

    could be::

      &foo->bar
      *foo->bar

